# aqp_docs/CODEOWNERS
#
# Maps every docs subdirectory to one engineering owner + one docs
# reviewer. The "Was this helpful?" Cloudflare Worker reads this file
# to route the resulting GitHub Issue at filing time, and the docs-CI
# workflow requires a CODEOWNER approval before any merge can land on
# `main`.
#
# Owners listed here MUST match GitHub Teams (case-sensitive).
# A page's `owner` frontmatter (see src/lib/frontmatterSchema.ts) is
# the agent-readable equivalent.

# Default — everything not otherwise claimed.
*                                       @julianwileymac/docs-team

# Configuration + tooling.
/docusaurus.config.ts                   @julianwileymac/platform-team @julianwileymac/docs-team
/sidebars.ts                            @julianwileymac/docs-team
/package.json                           @julianwileymac/platform-team
/tsconfig.json                          @julianwileymac/platform-team
/scripts/                               @julianwileymac/platform-team
/workers/                               @julianwileymac/platform-team @julianwileymac/sre-team
/src/                                   @julianwileymac/platform-team @julianwileymac/docs-team
/openapi/                               @julianwileymac/platform-team
/.vale/                                 @julianwileymac/docs-team

# Get started + tutorials.
/docs/intro/                            @julianwileymac/docs-team @julianwileymac/platform-team
/docs/tutorials/                        @julianwileymac/docs-team @julianwileymac/platform-team

